  "synopsis": "The McCallister family is planning a vacation in France for Christmas. They are also gathering other relatives, so their house is filled with people, everyone is noisy and in a hurry. On the day of departure, they oversleep the alarm due to a power outage and, in their rush, forget one of the children - Kevin, realizing this only when they are already on the plane. Kevin will now have to take care of himself. Kevin's mother, Kate, is trying to find a way to get back home. In the meantime, two burglars, Harry and Marv, are planning a robbery in the McCallister neighborhood, and their house is the next target. Kevin finds out about this and plans to defend his home on his own.",
